From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 02:10:57 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 59/60] Muse Spark: prompt cache (TF_MUSE_PROMPT_CACHE=1, off
 by default): kept prompt states pin the full layers' rows in their slot and
 copy the sliding and drafter windows (kept.zig, ~0.2 GiB a state a rank,
 TF_MUSE_PROMPT_CACHE_GIB cap 2); prefill cuts chunks at the cache's marks,
 resumes in the state's slot or copies its prefix rows into a free one when
 that slot is busy; slot choice keeps live states; Op.cache replays every copy
 on rank 1

